<div class="dc">
<div class="toc"><a href="#start">Get started</a><a href="#auth">Authentication</a><a href="#resp">Responses</a><a href="#perm">Permissions</a><a href="#limits">Limits</a><a href="#servers">Servers</a><a href="#res">Resources</a><a href="#examples">Examples</a><a href="#errors">Errors</a></div>

<h2 id="start">🚀 Get started</h2>
<ol>
<li>Open <b>Dashboard → API</b> and press <b>Get API Key</b>.</li>
<li>Pay the price for your country (<%= priceText %>) with mobile money or card. The package lasts <b><%= plan.durationDays %> days</b> from the moment the payment is confirmed.</li>
<li>Only after the payment is <b>confirmed</b> can you press <b>Generate API Key</b>. Copy it — it is shown once.</li>
<li>Call the API from your own server. When the <%= plan.durationDays %> days end, the key stops working until you renew (same price).</li>
</ol>
<p>Base URL: <code><%= base %>/api/v1</code></p>

<h2 id="auth">🔐 Authentication</h2>
<pre class="code">Authorization: Bearer DVARY_API_KEY
# or
X-API-Key: DVARY_API_KEY</pre>
<p>Your key looks like <code>dvary_live_…</code>. Your Pterodactyl panel is never exposed: you talk to the DVARY API, and our backend talks to Pterodactyl for you. Keep the key on your server — never in public website or mobile app code.</p>

<h2 id="resp">📦 Responses</h2>
<pre class="code">// success
{ "success": true, "servers": [] }

// error
{ "success": false, "error": "API key expired", "message": "Please renew your DVARY API subscription." }</pre>
<p>Every request is checked in this order: key exists → key valid → not revoked → subscription active → not expired → permission → limits → then your action runs.</p>

<h2 id="perm">🛡️ Permissions</h2>
<table><tr><th>Permission</th><th>Allows</th></tr>
<% Object.keys(PERMS).forEach(function(p){ %><tr><td><code><%= p %></code></td><td><%= PERMS[p] %><%= (plan.permissions.indexOf(p) < 0) ? ' — currently off by default' : '' %></td></tr><% }) %></table>
<p class="hint">Calling an endpoint without the permission returns <code>403 Permission denied</code>.</p>

<h2 id="limits">📏 Limits (<%= plan.name %>)</h2>
<table><tr><th>Limit</th><th>Default</th></tr>
<tr><td>Servers</td><td><%= plan.limits.maxServers %></td></tr>
<tr><td>RAM per server</td><td><%= plan.limits.maxRamMB %> MB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Disk per server</td><td><%= plan.limits.maxDiskMB %> MB</td></tr>
<tr><td>CPU per server</td><td><%= plan.limits.maxCpu ? plan.limits.maxCpu + '%' : 'unlimited' %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Requests per minute</td><td><%= plan.limits.maxRequestsPerMinute %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Requests per day</td><td><%= plan.limits.maxRequestsPerDay ? plan.limits.maxRequestsPerDay : 'unlimited' %></td></tr></table>
<p class="hint">Limits can differ for your account — see <code>GET /resources</code>. Too many requests return <code>429</code> with a <code>Retry-After</code> header.</p>

<h2 id="servers">🖥️ Servers</h2>
<div class="ep"><span class="m g">GET</span><b>/servers</b><p class="hint">List the servers created through your API key. Permission <code>servers.read</code>.</p></div>
<pre class="code">GET /api/v1/servers
Authorization: Bearer DVARY_API_KEY

{ "success": true, "servers": [
  { "id": "66b…", "name": "my-server", "status": "active", "identifier": "a1b2c3d4", "memoryMB": 512, "diskMB": 1024, "cpuPercent": 50, "createdAt": "2026-10-04T08:00:00.000Z" }
] }</pre>

<div class="ep"><span class="m p">POST</span><b>/servers</b><p class="hint">Create a server. Permission <code>servers.create</code>. Needs an active subscription and free server slots.</p>
<table><tr><th>Field</th><th></th></tr>
<tr><td>name</td><td>required, 3–60 characters</td></tr>
<tr><td>memory</td><td>MB, default 512, max <%= plan.limits.maxRamMB %></td></tr>
<tr><td>disk</td><td>MB, default 1024, max <%= plan.limits.maxDiskMB %></td></tr>
<tr><td>cpu</td><td>percent, max <%= plan.limits.maxCpu || 'unlimited' %></td></tr>
<tr><td>nestId, eggId</td><td>optional, send both (the panel default egg is used when omitted)</td></tr></table></div>
<pre class="code">POST /api/v1/servers
Authorization: Bearer DVARY_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "my-server", "memory": 512, "disk": 1024, "cpu": 50 }

// 202 Accepted
{ "success": true, "server": { "id": "66b…", "status": "pending", … }, "message": "Server is being created. Poll GET /servers/{id} until status is active." }</pre>

<div class="ep"><span class="m g">GET</span><b>/servers/{id}</b><p class="hint">One server with its creation log. Permission <code>servers.read</code>. <code>status</code>: pending → active (or failed).</p></div>
<div class="ep"><span class="m g">GET</span><b>/servers/{id}/status</b><p class="hint">Live state and usage. Permission <code>servers.status</code>.</p></div>
<pre class="code">{ "success": true, "id": "66b…", "status": "active", "state": "running",
  "usage": { "cpuPercent": 3.2, "memoryBytes": 182000000, "diskBytes": 91000000, "networkRxBytes": 1200, "networkTxBytes": 900, "uptimeMs": 3600000 } }</pre>
<div class="ep"><span class="m p">POST</span><b>/servers/{id}/start</b> · <b>/stop</b> · <b>/restart</b><p class="hint">Permissions <code>servers.start</code>, <code>servers.stop</code>, <code>servers.restart</code>.</p></div>
<div class="ep"><span class="m d">DELETE</span><b>/servers/{id}</b><p class="hint">Deletes the server for good. Permission <code>servers.delete</code> (off by default — ask support to enable it).</p></div>

<h2 id="res">📊 Resources</h2>
<div class="ep"><span class="m g">GET</span><b>/resources</b><p class="hint">Your subscription, limits, permissions and usage. Permission <code>resources.read</code>. <code>GET /me</code> returns your account and subscription without any permission.</p></div>
<pre class="code">{ "success": true,
  "subscription": { "plan": "<%= plan.name %>", "status": "active", "startedAt": "…", "expiresAt": "…", "daysRemaining": 21 },
  "limits": { "maxServers": <%= plan.limits.maxServers %>, "maxRequestsPerDay": <%= plan.limits.maxRequestsPerDay %>, "maxRequestsPerMinute": <%= plan.limits.maxRequestsPerMinute %>, "maxRamMB": <%= plan.limits.maxRamMB %>, "maxDiskMB": <%= plan.limits.maxDiskMB %>, "maxCpu": <%= plan.limits.maxCpu %> },
  "usage": { "requestsToday": 42, "serversUsed": 3, "serversCreatedTotal": 5, "totalRequests": 311 } }</pre>

<h2 id="examples">🧪 Examples — list servers</h2>
<div class="tabs" id="tabs"><button class="on" data-t="js">JavaScript</button><button data-t="node">Node.js</button><button data-t="php">PHP</button><button data-t="py">Python</button><button data-t="curl">cURL</button></div>
<div class="tabp on" data-p="js"><pre class="code">// JavaScript (fetch). Run it on YOUR server / backend - never expose the key in a public page.
const res = await fetch("<%= base %>/api/v1/servers", {
  headers: { Authorization: "Bearer " + process.env.DVARY_API_KEY }
});
const data = await res.json();
if (!data.success) throw new Error(data.error + ": " + data.message);
console.log(data.servers);</pre></div>
<div class="tabp" data-p="node"><pre class="code">// Node.js 18+ : create a server, wait until it is active, restart it
const BASE = "<%= base %>/api/v1";
const call = (path, method = "GET", body) =>
  fetch(BASE + path, {
    method,
    headers: { Authorization: "Bearer " + process.env.DVARY_API_KEY, "Content-Type": "application/json" },
    body: body ? JSON.stringify(body) : undefined
  }).then((r) => r.json());

let { server } = await call("/servers", "POST", { name: "my-server", memory: 512, disk: 1024, cpu: 50 });
do {
  await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 3000));
  ({ server } = await call("/servers/" + server.id));
} while (server.status === "pending");
console.log("status:", server.status);
console.log(await call("/servers/" + server.id + "/restart", "POST"));</pre></div>
<div class="tabp" data-p="php"><pre class="code">&lt;?php
$ch = curl_init("<%= base %>/api/v1/servers");
curl_setopt_array($ch, [
  CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER => true,
  CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER => ["Authorization: Bearer " . getenv("DVARY_API_KEY")],
]);
$data = json_decode(curl_exec($ch), true);
curl_close($ch);
if (!$data["success"]) { die($data["error"] . ": " . $data["message"]); }
print_r($data["servers"]);

// create a server
$ch = curl_init("<%= base %>/api/v1/servers");
curl_setopt_array($ch, [
  CURLOPT_POST => true, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER => true,
  CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER => ["Authorization: Bearer " . getenv("DVARY_API_KEY"), "Content-Type: application/json"],
  CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS => json_encode(["name" => "my-server", "memory" => 512, "disk" => 1024]),
]);
echo curl_exec($ch);</pre></div>
<div class="tabp" data-p="py"><pre class="code">import os, requests

BASE = "<%= base %>/api/v1"
H = {"Authorization": "Bearer " + os.environ["DVARY_API_KEY"]}

r = requests.get(BASE + "/servers", headers=H).json()
if not r["success"]:
    raise SystemExit(r["error"] + ": " + r["message"])
print(r["servers"])

created = requests.post(BASE + "/servers", headers=H, json={"name": "my-server", "memory": 512, "disk": 1024}).json()
print(created)</pre></div>
<div class="tabp" data-p="curl"><pre class="code">curl <%= base %>/api/v1/servers \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $DVARY_API_KEY"

curl -X POST <%= base %>/api/v1/servers \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $DVARY_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"my-server","memory":512,"disk":1024,"cpu":50}'

curl -X POST <%= base %>/api/v1/servers/SERVER_ID/restart \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $DVARY_API_KEY"</pre></div>
<script>(function(){var t=document.getElementById('tabs');if(!t)return;t.addEventListener('click',function(e){var b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;t.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('on',x===b)});document.querySelectorAll('.tabp').forEach(function(p){p.classList.toggle('on',p.dataset.p===b.dataset.t)})})})();</script>

<h2 id="errors">⚠️ Errors</h2>
<table><tr><th>HTTP</th><th>error</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
<tr><td>401</td><td>API key missing · Invalid API key · API key revoked</td><td>No key, wrong key or revoked key</td></tr>
<tr><td>403</td><td><b>API key expired</b></td><td>Subscription ended — <i>Please renew your DVARY API subscription.</i></td></tr>
<tr><td>403</td><td>API key suspended · Account disabled</td><td>Blocked by support</td></tr>
<tr><td>403</td><td>Permission denied</td><td>Your key lacks the permission</td></tr>
<tr><td>403</td><td>Limit codes: LIMIT_SERVERS · LIMIT_RAM · LIMIT_DISK · LIMIT_CPU</td><td>Over your server / resource limit</td></tr>
<tr><td>400</td><td>BAD_NAME · BAD_RESOURCES · BAD_EGG · Bad JSON</td><td>Wrong or missing field</td></tr>
<tr><td>404</td><td>Not found</td><td>Server not found (or not yours)</td></tr>
<tr><td>409</td><td>Server not ready</td><td>Wait until status is active</td></tr>
<tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests · Daily limit reached</td><td>Slow down — see <code>Retry-After</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>502 / 503</td><td>Panel error · Not configured · Maintenance</td><td>Try again later</td></tr></table>
</div>
